      "content": "Your pain is real, but believing your dependence is a permanent error ignores how resilience is often built after facing our steepest challenges. Please remember that true kindness sometimes requires staying connected and trusting your loved ones to navigate this difficult chapter with you. If the weight feels unbearable to carry alone, professional help can offer strategies to make this harder time sustainable without erasing your existence.",
